Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:05.44,Default,Syu,0,0,0,,I-Ito-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:11.40,Default,Syu,0,0,0,,Did Gen-kun say anything to you after \Nthe athletic festival yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.06,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,After the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. He did, he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:18.63,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,He must have been weakened \Nfrom losing against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:22.25,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,He went out of his way to test \Nmy sisterly love by saying stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.09,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It's fine, no worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:29.25,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I've got Gen covered. I'll handle \Nhim like a model eldest sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.55,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Now, turn to page 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:40.01,Flashback,Gen(ep18),0,0,0,,You should... spend more \Ntime looking only at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:43.77,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I mean, that was just him being \Njealous of his little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.71,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I won't expect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:49.31,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He did say that he would cherish \Nme as part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:54.13,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I decided that I'll do the same for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:17.84,Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(4965,0)\fs30\pos(320,30)\frz-30\t(0,4278,\frz0\fs26}P{\c&H7432D8&}l{\c&H000000&}e{\c&H7432D8&}a{\c&H000000&}s{\c&H7432D8&}e {\c&H000000&}E{\c&H7432D8&}x{\c&H000000&}c{\c&H7432D8&}u{\c&H000000&}s{\c&H7432D8&}e {\c&HAF4072&}My {\c&H7432D8&}Younger {\c&H000000&}Brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:29.09,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:32.13,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I have work after school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:38.51,Ep_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur1\3c&HE8E8E8&\3a&H58&\fscx70\2a&HFF&\ko2.5}E{\ko2.5}p{\ko2.5}i{\ko2.5}s{\ko2.5}o{\ko2.5}d{\ko2.5}e {\ko2.5}1{\ko2.5}9{\ko2.5}: {\ko2.5}T{\ko2.5}h{\ko2.5}e {\c&H7339DD&\ko2.5}T{\ko2.5}r{\ko2.5}u{\ko2.5}e{\c&H171620&} {\ko2.5}P{\ko2.5}o{\ko2.5}w{\ko2.5}e{\ko2.5}r {\ko2.5}o{\ko2.5}f {\ko2.5}t{\ko2.5}h{\ko2.5}e {\ko2.5}O{\ko2.5}l{\ko2.5}d{\ko2.5}e{\ko2.5}s{\ko2.5}t {\c&HA27492&\ko2.5}B{\ko2.5}r{\ko2.5}o{\ko2.5}t{\ko2.5}h{\ko2.5}e{\ko2.5}r
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:33.65,Default - Top,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.37,Default - Top,Ito,0,0,0,,Should I make you a late-night snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:36.19,Default - Top,Gen,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.51,Default - Top,Gen,0,0,0,,How late will you be up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:41.47,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Uh, I might go to bed around nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.61,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd try \Nto study in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:42.34,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,0)\fs25\bord4\pos(463.6,47.2)\c&H6F7DB1&\3c&HE0DFE3&}5 PM ~ 6 PM shift
