Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:42.60,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord4\pos(463.6,47.2)\c&H6F7DB1&\3c&HE0DFE3&}5 PM ~ 7 PM shift
