Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.85,0:02:43.10,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fs25\pos(463.6,47.2)\c&H6F7DB1&\3c&H4F5370&}5 PM ~ 9 PM shift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:43.97,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord4\pos(463.6,47.2)\c&H6F7DB1&\3c&HE0DFE3&}5 PM ~ 10 PM shift
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.10,0:02:43.97,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fs25\pos(463.6,47.2)\c&H6F7DB1&\3c&H4F5370&}5 PM ~ 10 PM shift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.69,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,They say that you get good \Nideas early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:48.01,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:49.60,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You should try it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.31,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:53.31,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Good luck with work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.85,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:59.86,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,If you want her to stay up for you, \Nyou have to ask her more directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:03.51,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Or how about, \N"I'll keep you up all night."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.03,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}wrong{\i0} with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:07.77,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,All of you just say \Nwhatever pops in your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.63,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Syu included?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:14.67,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Do you just always know \Neverything, every time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.97,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Talk about a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.13,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,If I was a girl, I'd pick him. He's nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.01,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,So, does that mean she's also \Nmore interested in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.85,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Is that why she's acting \Nlike nothing happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.45,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,So you're finally aware of it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:35.69,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,And now you want her to \Nsee you in that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.36,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Do you get how self-centered that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:41.15,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:42.55,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Do you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.58,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Even if she doesn't show it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:48.29,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,she's been given the same runaround\Nyou got, but more than twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:52.22,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You better have enough grit \Nto make up for all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.65,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Or you're not even at the starting line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:01.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs6\fax0.15\bord0\c&HCEE0F3&\frz340.9\pos(431.115,188.267)}Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:03.11,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,I'm excited to meet the new \Nemployee starting next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:04.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.03,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,What did he mean by "have enough grit?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.89,Flashback_Italics,Raku,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:12.12,Flashback,Raku,0,0,0,,You didn't say you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:14.57,Flashback,Raku,0,0,0,,Seriously, why'd you think\N that would work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.79,Flashback,Raku,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:18.41,Flashback,Raku,0,0,0,,The esteemed eldest brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:21.86,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,He didn't have to be that appalled...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:28.07,Default,Coworker,0,0,0,,Oh, right. The boss wants you to \Nhandle training the new person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:29.24,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:32.24,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,Does that mean she didn't \Nget what I meant at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.34,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,From how I acted, \Nit should've been clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.12,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:38.45,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Please go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:40.55,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.97,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,I love you, too! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:50.56,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,Putting it into words is so much \Nmore intense on many levels...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:52.81,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:56.34,Italics,Gen(M),0,0,0,,if the other person doesn't get it,\N nothing's gonna happen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.60,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.38,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you were\N going to bed at nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:09.99,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I-I saw a thing on TV talking about how \Nstudying before bed is also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.67,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.67,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I was waiting up until you got home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.92,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,As the oldest sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.77,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,of course I'm gonna worry \Nabout you getting home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.57,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Is that really all it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.63,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this, even?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.68,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Stop making things weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:32.71,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.14,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:36.66,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,The vibes are super weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.54,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:39.83,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:42.02,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You seem like a boy, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.87,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I am one, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:46.90,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs10\bord0\c&H383C42&\fax-0.1\pos(605.12,327.68)\frz8.37}(Narita Rui)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:46.90,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, but that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.16,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I can't really express it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:53.87,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Anyway, you've been acting not so \Nlittle brotherly lately and it's not cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:06:04.92,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\bord0\c&H383C42&\fax-0.2\frz23.37\move(607,210,607,252)}(Narita Rui)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:55.04,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.29,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I don't think of you as \Nmy older sister anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.26,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You didn't get what I meant\N yesterday, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:04.92,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I wasn't saying that as a little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:08.19,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I was saying that you \Nshould see me as a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.18,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,So do you get what I mean now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.93,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:16.56,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting things \Nto take this turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.49,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I do not get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.06,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(739,0)\fs15\fscx90\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\c&H42454D&\pos(557.76,252.8)}River fun \N{\fs10}(Narita Rui)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:22.33,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:23.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:25.86,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,The things I said were \Na bad influence on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.95,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It's terrible from a pedagogical\N standpoint. So sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:31.12,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to \Npretend nothing happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.62,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This is too stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:38.16,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Look, you're right to be pissed \Nbecause I took forever and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.47,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,But I'm saying that I still \Nfell in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.30,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,It's so utterly stupid \Nthat I hate myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.34,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:50.05,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.89,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I just want you to forget \Nabout me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:54.38,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:01.11,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,All of this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:07.60,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,God, if it's possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:10.78,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'd like to start over from \Nwhen we all first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:17.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.45,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.32,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you for the meal—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:29.51,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What the hell does he think he's doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.98,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Stop drinking straight from the carton!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.14,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What if someone sees?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.76,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I wonder if he's still mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.68,Default,Syu,0,0,0,,Everything okay, Ito-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:44.00,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I just remembered something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:46.19,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'll have to go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:52.36,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Just wondering... Did you\N do something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.50,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.79,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Does he understand what he's saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.35,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,If our feelings for each other are mutual,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:03.67,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,that means we'd become a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:07.21,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Actually, what do couples do, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:09.59,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I can't even imagine it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:14.30,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(313.6,145.6)\c&HCED6D1&\bord0\fax0.05\frz1.796}Self-Study
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.30,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,What do boyfriends and girlfriends do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.18,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,That's outta the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.48,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Um, so... I've got this friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.97,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,A guy who's kinda like a little brother\N to her confessed his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:23.84,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.31,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,So they're gonna date!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:26.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,No, they won't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:32.71,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,To be honest, I do think \Nthat sounds nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:36.24,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,If they date, they'll see how it goes, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:39.81,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,If you do everything there is to it, \Nit might not even be a big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:40.83,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:44.08,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,When you say "do everything," \Nwhat do you mean, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:48.18,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,Y'know, like going on dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:48.73,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:50.50,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,Holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.55,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.63,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,And let the mood take you to kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.15,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.68,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Imagining it was a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.46,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,C'mon, Itopi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.70,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,If this is enough to do you in, what \Nabout when you get to you-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.28,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:10.19,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's you-know-what, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:24.87,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'm so rattled...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.96,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'll look at practice exam \Nquestions and calm myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:34.49,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,So in actuality, what {\i0}did{\i1} I want \Nto happen with Gen and I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:38.42,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,My head was already \Ncompletely full of "love."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:43.97,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I never even thought about what \Nto do if he reciprocated...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:45.60,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Don't scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.26,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,An assault?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.98,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen \Nif you make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.68,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:54.52,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:58.07,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I came here to be somewhere \Nquiet and cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.37,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.73,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Can I come over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.04,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:10.77,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\fnVerdana\bord2\blur2\c&H463E36&\fscx90\pos(122.8,54.8)\3c&HF0F2F4&}Captured?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.27,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Am I captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.51,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Couldn't we just talk in \Na more normal setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:17.30,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,No. You'd run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:20.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:27.48,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Did you stop caring about\N me completely, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:32.08,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I don't really know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.81,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm happy that you feel that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:38.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,but it's not an appropriate \Nway to feel about family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:42.49,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Not to mention, I don't know why you \Nhad to say it now, all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.93,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You even tried to get me \Ntogether with Raku-kun before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:50.18,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:55.50,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's because back then, I had \Nno idea what you were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:11:01.28,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,For the longest time, I was convinced \Nthat I wanted to cherish you as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:05.99,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,But now I don't have the confidence \Nto stick to that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:13.24,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,When you told me you loved me, \NI was actually really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.88,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,'Cause I didn't have to \Ndefer to anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.09,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,and I could just treat you\N extra special myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:21.74,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:27.12,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I know we shouldn't be \Nin such proximity...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.50,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What were you trying to do just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.94,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Y'know, just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.40,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,"A little" {\i1}what{\i0}?! Where's this going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.97,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You didn't run away and \NI wanted to, so I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:47.12,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I gotta nip this in the bud before \NI can't restrain myself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.65,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Gen, this is important, \Nso please listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:55.32,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,The order in our household is \Nmore important to me than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:59.88,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I can't get our parents out of my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:04.41,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,and I just can't prioritize what I want\N if it means trouble for the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:07.78,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,So, you're just going to \Ntake back what you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.21,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:15.42,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Because I don't see another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:18.70,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.80,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:27.37,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You mean, as long as you live in our \Nhouse, you can't change how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:30.39,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I guess that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:34.31,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:40.03,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:43.73,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I know I have no right to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:47.19,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,but he didn't have to give up that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:52.16,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I guess by now, Gen must \Nhave really given up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:56.00,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,If he won't even consider \Nme his older sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.97,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'll just have to accept this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:02.63,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Can I really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:05.97,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,It's not a matter of can! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:09.71,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Huh? Did Gen even come home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:21.48,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Raku-kun, what do we do?! Gen's not back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:24.44,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, he is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.60,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Didn't he just take a last-minute shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.92,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,He always texts when that happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to \Nreach his phone, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.21,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,It's not like he's run away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.00,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,That doesn't sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:40.96,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,unlike him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:47.30,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He hates me so much, he doesn't \Neven want to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:49.80,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,If anyone should leave, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:51.93,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:57.06,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:13:59.52,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:01.57,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,It's late, so I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.69,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Yes. We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:09.82,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Sorry. Once Mom starts talking, \Nshe doesn't really stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:10.88,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.33,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.45,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:14.89,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,All kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:20.92,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Looks like I can't have a real talk with \Nyou unless I take the proper steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.12,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.85,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,If I get Mom and Dad's\N permission on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:30.16,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,reconsider how you think about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.33,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:39.61,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Unlike you, if I say something, \NI don't take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.74,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey. Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:49.35,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,How much did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:49.86,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:53.14,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad. Did you tell them everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.91,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,No. Mom answered the phone, \Nso I talked to her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.29,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Wh-What? You even told her I confessed \Nto you and you rejected me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:01.51,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:04.81,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I told her I see you as a regular girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:08.99,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I mean, you change your tune all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:12.09,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to explain it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:13.90,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.60,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'm happy-embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.71,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.06,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:24.19,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Forget about any permissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:27.29,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,We might not be able to live \Nin this house together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:32.76,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,We promised to not let things get \Nweird so that we can live like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:37.54,Flashback,Gen(ep3),0,0,0,,I'm not so desperate that\NI'd be into this Kintaro lookalike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:40.74,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Oh. Guess that turned out to be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.04,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Don't snort-laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:43.58,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:45.98,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's honestly how I felt back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:47.92,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,How can he...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:51.29,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's not like you \Ncan undo falling in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:55.18,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,...easily do what's so impossible to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:57.13,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Once it happens, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.50,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,So all you can do is \Nthink of how to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:03.68,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This must be the true power of the oldest\N brother who realized he's in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:09.62,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I thought I had him all figured out, but \Nit looks like I didn't know him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.09,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:15.37,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,We really need to think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:18.42,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Let's call an emergency family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:22.41,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Tomorrow night, with you, \Nme, and our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.48,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Why don't I teach him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.51,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,how unforgiving the world is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:30.93,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Get ready to be shocked \Nby your own naiveté.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:34.09,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Is everyone doing good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.09,0:16:37.30,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Then let's begin the \Nemergency family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.51,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,She's so cheerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.58,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Um, where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:43.85,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,He's on a business trip, \Nso it's just me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:47.12,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Dang. I didn't check...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.15,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This makes me a bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:54.04,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I also get the feeling Mom won't feel \Ncomfortable speaking harshly to Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.50,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I heard the news, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:59.24,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Is it true that you and \NGen-kun are an item now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:02.01,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Th-Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:04.75,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Don't say that! What if \NGen overheard you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.68,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Just between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:11.85,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,if I was younger, a handsome boy \Nlike Gen-kun would be up my alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:15.70,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,But he still can't hold \Na candle to Isao-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:18.09,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,She's not taking this seriously at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:21.72,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,But we can't really start \Nuntil Gen-kun gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:23.60,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:25.29,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He's been here, listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:28.04,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,I figured it'd be kinda weird\N if we're all in one room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:29.45,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,so I joined from another room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:32.45,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,My, how considerate of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:34.24,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Is there a problem with your video?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.99,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,I just couldn't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:37.37,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:39.99,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,So, to continue our \Nconversation from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:44.75,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,How do you honestly feel about our \Nrelationship developing that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:47.39,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hey, can you not go there right away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.39,0:17:49.11,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,You weren't going anywhere, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.04,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I was just about to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:52.97,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Oh, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.76,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I am totally fine with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:59.76,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,You two make such a wonderful \Ncouple, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:03.00,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I think it would be quite \Na shock for your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.39,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,so I haven't told him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:07.03,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,But I imagine he would \Naccept it, in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:08.67,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,So it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:10.88,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Ito-chan, if you're fine with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:13.20,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I'd even say I definitely \Nwant you two to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.82,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is, \Nshe's the one who first...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.06,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,No. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.68,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You don't need to talk about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:20.70,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Oh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.58,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,S-So, hypothetically...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.72,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Let's say Gen and I are dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:27.96,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hypothetically!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.21,Italics,Ito,0,0,0,,"I knew that family's not normal."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:37.59,Italics,Ito,0,0,0,,People might think less of Gen, \NDad, you, and everyone for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.63,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Ito-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:43.73,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This isn't something that concerns only us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:45.85,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I know I'm being self-centered,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:49.48,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,but I don't want "love" to be\N the only basis for this decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:53.48,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,How could you be worried \Nabout such a stupid thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.11,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Say what, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:18:58.94,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:01.41,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,This is probably my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:05.66,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Ever since you were little, \Nyou were always there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:08.47,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,And that forced you to be \Nconsiderate in so many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.91,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,That's why I've been wanting \Nyou to live more freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:14.67,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,It's also why I agreed to \Nlet you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:20.82,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,But in the end, you still \Nput your family first again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.41,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,While I do love that side of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:27.85,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I also hope you'll prioritize \Nwhat you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:33.00,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,As your parents, your \Nhappiness is our happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:36.12,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I don't care what strangers might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.17,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,You're the one who's important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.95,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Whatever it is you do, you will \Nalways have my full support.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.25,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,So please, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:48.49,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Be honest about how you feel, \Nso you won't have any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:52.49,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,So Ito-chan, what do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.99,0:19:55.71,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,How do you want to respond \Nto Gen-kun's feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.43,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,How can I be so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.85,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This is about me, but I was trying \Nto let someone else decide for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:05.18,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Well, it's pretty obvious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.64,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,The way you feel about \NGen-kun is surely lo—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.29,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'll say it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.95,0:20:17.23,Italics,Ito,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:24.18,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,If I'm honest, I want to tell you\N that I love you so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:28.24,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,But I didn't have the confidence that \NI had what it takes to handle Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:32.97,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Because whenever he looks at me, \Nit makes me unable to think clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:35.69,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Then congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:39.17,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Looks like your feelings for each \Nother are officially mutual now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:42.86,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,While I would like to leave \Nthe rest to you young people,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:44.97,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,but since you are living under one roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:47.30,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I do have some concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:50.06,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.37,0:20:55.69,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I mean, don't be all lovey-dovey \Nall over the place. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:58.80,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,I do intend to stay rational about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:21:00.97,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Of course! I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:05.39,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Maybe the day when I become \Na grandmother isn't so far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.75,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,That's moving quite fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:10.95,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,How can they talk about this \Nkind of thing so calmly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:13.06,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.85,0:21:17.02,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I won't lay a finger on Ito \Nas long as we're in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:21.16,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's the rule I set for \Nmyself so that it's clear that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:22.46,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm not playing any games.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:31.77,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:36.65,Italics,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but my phone's battery's \Nabout to die, so I'll drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:41.90,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,My, you are loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.16,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,I can relax now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:46.63,Italics,Saho,0,0,0,,Gen-kun's someone I can entrust you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:51.39,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Mom, thanks for this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:56.04,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but \NGen was probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:21:58.75,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,Once it happens, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:00.81,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,So all you can do is \Nthink of how to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.51,0:22:05.81,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm also glad that \NI fell in love with Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.61,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I just have to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:12.53,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,No matter what happens, there will \Nbe someone who will accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:18.31,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'm not going to suppress \Nmy feelings anymore.
